# Background image updates: rpm-ostreed-automatic.timer runs `rpm-ostree
# upgrade` under the policy in /etc/rpm-ostreed.conf (stage), so the next
# deployment is downloaded while the machine is on and boots next power-on.
# Preset matching is lexicographic and first-match-wins, so this 80- file
# beats Fedora's 90-systemd.preset catchall `disable *`.
enable rpm-ostreed-automatic.timer